# Cursor Rule — Architecture

Read `.ai/03-architecture.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` before structural changes.

- Separation of concerns; one reason to change per module.
- No silent architectural changes — propose an ADR in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
- Get approval before swapping frameworks, databases, or major libraries.
- Preserve existing interfaces unless explicitly authorized.
- Prefer boring, proven patterns.
